": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gS9hVRR7NgEQ7kNvwHdn0GH&_nc_oc=AdpMS17wHS9sRyjl0HxIJNtD5o9DTjNKkt3bJjD6kO2S2IcRSWOgiY3aLsd9QFFLLyQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQICrPAsbDkgwQWlSi7kb1CryeKWZZM7h-MO6X3rspUGgA&oe=6AB69C1B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mZoZ8IHFISsQ7kNvwE6TX5b&_nc_oc=Adpfjl_e9QH2UeAGkPlMXCZEGmxAJKhS67ds3Q9rm-Uvei792XCohSVg6rwBBHo98vc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI9in-iq8JqBxmVpbIdn_uSHNnslsx3j6NFkvRn7wgNhA&oe=6AB68C61"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hLRR9sxwqoYQ7kNvwELSVeB&_nc_oc=AdrZHQcuTl5WvLHDriNxWkKFmGgTrN7Rs2f9TyQXZjbinLSTB8k63mYk0H1Y_Xifyn8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIhwJrJ_spZsSE8VUez12dJGFU3w02bSaov3bJ2EHbBOA&oe=6AB6792F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f16d-SkNUmgQ7kNvwFwanNJ&_nc_oc=Ado47-65rut_ftPvTmtilgDIFLoIyVu7VQEo6oAvP9X4KXs_KkucXGxxIg5ExCV_bxw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIqnLxBbpqSOm0IGYHM9-NTUlmho_dlrtivXXpmLA5n8w&oe=6AB678D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UAL--RTfU_QQ7kNvwFN4rTx&_nc_oc=AdqxPN9amETv--12pSrq-dbA0wDgygXYN02f80lBZsu0X0YJHxpOGBShsg9LmfYfg_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJBQkenWJl8qLIExAzuZcXw3976bDntAC9DHyQhANhYtA&oe=6AB6827D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a